WEBVTT

00:05:59.482 --> 00:06:02.070
VG: Summer of Selma will be
an annual pilgrimage

00:06:02.094 --> 00:06:04.093
that will include a walk --

00:06:04.117 --> 00:06:05.679
54 miles,

00:06:05.703 --> 00:06:08.721
the sacred route from Selma to Montgomery.

00:06:08.745 --> 00:06:11.379
It will also include rigorous training.

00:06:11.403 --> 00:06:12.630
Picture it,

00:06:12.654 --> 00:06:16.750
as women come to learn organizing
and recruitment strategies,

00:06:16.774 --> 00:06:18.682
to study exercise science,

00:06:18.706 --> 00:06:20.447
to take nutrition classes,

00:06:20.471 --> 00:06:22.197
to learn storytelling,

00:06:22.221 --> 00:06:25.291
to become certified
as outdoor trip leaders

00:06:25.315 --> 00:06:27.547
and community advocates.

00:06:28.474 --> 00:06:30.376
TMD: This is going to be unprecedented.